          Demonstrate compliance with privacy laws and protect customer information through structured data handling and consent processes.
        </p>
        <div class="pill-row">
          <span class="pill brand">Privacy by design</span>
          <span class="pill">Data governance</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card lift feature" href={`${base}services/iso42001`} aria-label="AI Governance">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/>
            <path d="M2 12h4m12 0h4M12 2v4m0 12v4m-7.8-7.8l2.8 2.8m9.2-9.2l-2.8 2.8m0 6.4l2.8 2.8m-9.2-9.2l-2.8-2.8"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Responsible AI</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Put structure around AI use — ensuring transparency, accountability, and control of your models and data.
        </p>
        <div class="pill-row">
          <span class="pill brand">AI risk</span>
          <span class="pill">Transparency</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card lift feature" href={`${base}services/essential-eight`} aria-label="Essential Eight uplift">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7"/>
            <rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7"/>
            <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7"/>
            <rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Cyber Maturity (Essential Eight)</h3>
        <p class="muted">
