          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/>
            <path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Client Assurance (SOC 2)</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Show your clients you take security and privacy seriously — with independent verification and ready-made audit evidence.
        </p>
        <div class="pill-row">
          <span class="pill brand">Client trust</span>
          <span class="pill">Audit confidence</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card lift feature" href={`${base}services/disp-ism-irap`} aria-label="Defence & government frameworks">
        <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
            <path d="M3 21h18M6 21V9l6-6 6 6v12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Defence & Government Standards</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Align to government and defence requirements — including DISP, ISM and IRAP — with clear evidence and practical controls.
        </p>
        <div class="pill-row">
          <span class="pill brand">Defence ready</span>
          <span class="pill">ISM aligned</span>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VALUE STRIP / MS TOOLS -->
  <section class="container section">
    <div class="card" style="border-radius:22px; overflow:hidden; text-align:center; padding:32px 0;">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;">Use the tools you already have.</h3>
      <p class="muted lead" style="margin:0 0 20px;">
        No extra platforms or logins. We configure and automate compliance inside your Microsoft&nbsp;365 stack.
      </p>

      <img
        src={(import.meta.env.BASE_URL) + 'assets/ms-tools.svg'}
        alt="Microsoft 365 compliance evidence components"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        style="width:100%; max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; display:block;"
      />

      <p class="muted small" style="margin:20px 0 0;">
        Evidence flows across SharePoint, Entra, Defender, Intune, Purview &amp; Sentinel.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-strip" style="text-align:center; margin-top:24px;">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={ctaUrl} aria-label="Book a roadmap call">
          Talk to team →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FREE CHECKLISTS -->
  <section id="checklist" class="container section-tight">
    <div class="card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;border-radius:22px;text-align:center;padding:24px 24px 20px;">
      <div style="max-width:780px; margin:0 auto;">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px;">Free interactive readiness checklists</h3>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:0;">
          Run a quick health check on your cyber, privacy and AI programs.
          Get instant gap scores for ISO 27001, ISO 27701, ISO 42001, Essential Eight, SOC 2 and
          DISP / ISM / IRAP — plus a downloadable PDF roadmap you can share with your team.
        </p>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px;justify-content:center;">
          <span class="pill">Auto score</span>
          <span class="pill">PDF export</span>
          <span class="pill">Progress tracker</span>
          <span class="pill">No account required</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={`${base}checklist/`}>View all checklists</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="muted small" style="margin-top:14px;max-width:760px;margin-inline:auto;text-align:center;">
      Use these free checklists to run a quick gap assessment before committing to a full ISO 27001, ISO 27701, ISO 42001,
      Essential Eight, SOC 2 or DISP / ISM / IRAP implementation project.
    </p>

    <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px;border-radius:14px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <span class="muted small">
        We don’t store your checklist answers. PDFs are generated in your browser.
        If you share your email, we may send relevant ISO, privacy and AI governance resources. No spam.
      </span>
      <a class="small" href={(import.meta.env.BASE_URL) + 'privacy'}>Privacy policy →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TESTIMONIALS (your existing carousel remains intact) -->
  <section id="outcomes" class="container section">
    <h2>Customer outcomes</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:-4px">
      Measurable results — from faster certifications to automated audits.
    </p>

    <div class="t-carousel" aria-roledescription="carousel">
      <div class="t-viewport" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="t-track" id="tTrack">
          <figure class="t-slide">
            <blockquote>
              <svg class="t-quote" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 11h3V5H5v6c0 3 2 5 5 5v-2c-2 0-3-1-3-3zm9 0h3V5h-5v6c0 3 2 5 5 5v-2c-2 0-3-1-3-3z" fill="currentColor"/>
              </svg>
              We stood up ISO 27001 in ten weeks. Evidence lived in SharePoint, our auditors loved it, and we hit the vendor deadline without overtime.
            </blockquote>
            <figcaption>
              <div class="t-avatar t-initial" aria-hidden="true">S</div>
              <div>
                <strong>SaaS Provider</strong> — CTO<br/>
                <span class="muted small">ISO 27001 • zero non-conformities</span>
              </div>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="t-slide">
            <blockquote>
              <svg class="t-quote" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 11h3V5H5v6c0 3 2 5 5 5v-2c-2 0-3-1-3-3zm9 0h3V5h-5v6c0 3 2 5 5 5v-2c-2 0-3-1-3-3z" fill="currentColor"/>
              </svg>
              Our AI governance rollout passed vendor risk reviews first time. The AIMS evidence trail in M365 made it painless.
            </blockquote>
            <figcaption>
              <div class="t-avatar t-initial" aria-hidden="true">H</div>
              <div>
                <strong>Health SaaS</strong> — COO<br/>
                <span class="muted small">ISO 42001 • model inventory & oversight</span>
              </div>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>

          <figure class="t-slide">
            <blockquote>
              <svg class="t-quote" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 11h3V5H5v6c0 3 2 5 5 5v-2c-2 0-3-1-3-3zm9 0h3V5h-5v6c0 3 2 5 5 5v-2c-2 0-3-1-3-3z" fill="currentColor"/>
              </svg>
              We lifted Essential Eight maturity without buying more tools. Monthly snapshots to SharePoint kept audits simple.
            </blockquote>
            <figcaption>
              <div class="t-avatar t-initial" aria-hidden="true">G</div>
              <div>
                <strong>Gov contractor</strong> — CISO<br/>
                <span class="muted small">E8 uplift • audit-ready evidence</span>
              </div>
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="t-controls" aria-label="Carousel controls">
        <button class="t-btn" id="tPrev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button>
        <div class="t-dots" id="tDots" role="tablist" aria-label="Slides"></div>
        <button class="t-btn" id="tNext" aria-label="Next">›</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <style is:inline>
      .t-viewport{overflow:hidden;border-radius:18px}
      .t-track{display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;transform:translateX(0);transition:transform .6s cubic-bezier(.22,.75,.25,1)}
      .t-slide{flex:0 0 100%;min-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}
    </style>

    <script is:inline>
      (function(){
        const track = document.getElementById('tTrack');
        const slides = Array.from(track.children);
        const prev   = document.getElementById('tPrev');
        const next   = document.getElementById('tNext');
        const dotsCt = document.getElementById('tDots');

        let index = 0;
        let timer = null;

        slides.forEach((_, i) => {
          const b = document.createElement('button');
          b.type = 'button';
          b.setAttribute('role','tab');
          b.setAttribute('aria-label', `Go to slide ${i+1}`);
          if(i === 0) b.setAttribute('aria-current','true');
          b.addEventListener('click', () => go(i, true));
          dotsCt.appendChild(b);
        });

        function updateUI(){
          const pct = -(index * 100);
          track.style.transform = `translateX(${pct}%)`;
          [...dotsCt.children].forEach((d, i) => {
            if(i === index) d.setAttribute('aria-current','true'); else d.removeAttribute('aria-current');
          });
        }
        function go(i, stopAuto=false){ index = (i + slides.length) % slides.length; updateUI(); if(stopAuto) restartAuto(); }
        function nextSlide(){ go(index + 1); }
        function prevSlide(){ go(index - 1, true); }

        prev.addEventListener('click', prevSlide);
        next.addEventListener('click', () => go(index + 1, true));

        function startAuto(){ timer = setInterval(nextSlide, 6000); }
        function stopAuto(){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; }
        function restartAuto(){ stopAuto(); startAuto(); }

        const carousel = document.querySelector('.t-carousel');
        carousel.addEventListener('mouseenter', stopAuto);
        carousel.addEventListener('mouseleave', startAuto);
        carousel.addEventListener('focusin',  stopAuto);
        carousel.addEventListener('focusout', startAuto);

        updateUI();
        startAuto();
        addEventListener('resize', () => updateUI());
      })();
    </script>
  </section>

  
<!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="container section">
    <h2>Security, Privacy & AI — Common Questions</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="margin-top:-6px">
      The most frequent questions we hear when teams begin their compliance journey.
    </p>

    <div class="faq-grid" role="list">

      <!-- SECURITY -->
      <article class="faq-card" role="listitem">
        <details>
          <summary>
            <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l7 4v6c0 5-3.5 9-7 10-3.5-1-7-5-7-10V6l7-4z"/></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="faq-q">How do you help improve security maturity?</span>
            <span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </summary>
          <div class="faq-body">
            <p>
              We assess your current controls, then align them to recognised standards such as ISO 27001, Essential Eight, or SOC 2. 
              Everything is configured inside your Microsoft 365 environment — so evidence lives where your team already works.
            </p>
            <div class="pill-row">
              <span class="pill brand">Microsoft 365</span>
              <span class="pill">Controls &amp; Evidence</span>
              <span class="pill">Audit Ready</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </article>

      <article class="faq-card" role="listitem">
        <details>
